Manage jj-backed active-session Strap history.

Usage:
  strap history init
  strap history status
  strap history snapshot --message "after session setup"
  strap history log
  strap history new
  strap history restore <rev>
  strap history ui

History is stored in the session directory selected by `STRAP_SESSION`. Session mutations automatically snapshot with jj; `snapshot` remains available for explicit checkpoints. `ui` launches jjui in that session directory.
